<%- include('partials/header') %>

<!-- Main section for projects completed during my studies -->
<main class="container py-5">
  <h1 class="text-center mb-4">My Projects</h1>

  <!-- Bootstrap grid keeps the project cards responsive on different screen sizes -->
  <div class="row g-4">

    <!-- Business Analysis project -->
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="card-title h4">Business Analysis Excel Project</h2>
          <p class="card-text">
            In this project, I used Excel to organize and analyze data using
            PivotTables and dashboards. It helped me understand how data can
            be presented clearly and used to find useful information.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project Management group project -->
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="card-title h4">Mobile Games for Music Creators</h2>
          <p class="card-text">
            For this project, my group planned a mobile game designed to help
            beginners learn about audio mixing. I worked on areas such as the
            project scope, requirements, deliverables and work breakdown structure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Structures assignment -->
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="card-title h4">Three Stacks in One Array</h2>
          <p class="card-text">
            For this assignment, I worked on implementing three stacks using
            one array. It helped me understand how stacks work and how data
            can be organized efficiently.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Computer Architecture assignment -->
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="card-title h4">Computer Architecture Assignment</h2>
          <p class="card-text">
            This assignment involved topics such as cache memory, memory
            hierarchy and computer performance. It helped me better understand
            how different parts of a computer system work together.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Personal development project -->
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="card-title h4">Time Management Development Plan</h2>
          <p class="card-text">
            For this project, I focused on improving my time management and
            consistency. I tracked my progress and used weekly planning to
            improve how I managed schoolwork and deadlines.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>